{"id":"79d52eb1efe7","publishedAt":1793959248000,"posts":[[{"text":"↓第1話です↓"},{"br":1},{"text":"↓昨日の記事です↓"},{"br":1},{"text":"※3割ぐらいはフィクションです"},{"br":1},{"text":"受け入れてくれたお店の支配人が…"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/naekumasakura/imgs/6/2/62faec2c.jpg"},{"br":1},{"text":"怖いくらいの大嘘だわ"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/naekumasakura/imgs/6/3/63778480.jpg"},{"br":1},{"text":"若干、心が痛む…"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/naekumasakura/imgs/3/5/357529f6.jpg"},{"br":1},{"text":"ウチのお店が合わなくて"},{"br":1},{"text":"あんな態度だった可能性も"},{"br":1},{"text":"あったのかもしれないですし…"},{"br":1},{"text":"。。。単純にこの人の人間性の問題だわ"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"text":"・"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/naekumasakura/imgs/c/a/cae2f7dc.jpg"},{"br":1},{"text":"！？"},{"br":1},{"text":"↓もちくま↓"},{"br":1},{"text":"↓オススメ連載(全24話)↓"}]],"comments":[]}